{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/91bf09450696fec164d15ac57097caf8.avif?t=1757852991\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHANHAI: Myth Origins</strong> is a MOBA-style action roguelike inspired by the <i>Shanhaijing</i>. Venture into its otherworld, forge divine weapons with your own hands, wield the Five Elements\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth\u2014collect artifacts, bind spirits, and capture beasts. Uncover ancient secrets solo or fight side-by-side with up to four friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legend of the Three Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/9a97d49d039b6394f883142e92e8581d.avif?t=1757852991\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend holds that reaching the end of the Three Stars grants immortality. But the three stars that had shone upon the earth for centuries suddenly vanished. Just before they disappeared, a beam of green light was seen striking the land, triggering a cataclysmic explosion. Countless fragments, glowing green, scattered across the world and unleashed a great flood. Soon, wondrous beasts with mysterious powers began to appear. A figure wearing a bronze mask, wielding five-colored mystic stones, led these creatures to tame the deluge, ushering in an era of peaceful coexistence. Then, one day, the beasts turned violent, attacking humans and plunging the world into darkness and despair. Our hero sets out on a fated journey to save the people and uncover the secret of the Three Stars\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Five-Element Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/eb2698a2f8069650c3f421a4749eaad3.poster.avif?t=1757852991\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/eb2698a2f8069650c3f421a4749eaad3.webm?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/eb2698a2f8069650c3f421a4749eaad3.mp4?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the interplay and counterforces of the Five Elements\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth. Only by mastering their relationships can you restrain and defend against mythic beasts. Choose the right <strong>Spirit Orbs</strong>, socket them into weapons or armor, and forge truly unique builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Teeming with Shanhaijing Beasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/4b4e950eac2a39626c43b6999b00b112.poster.avif?t=1757852991\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/4b4e950eac2a39626c43b6999b00b112.webm?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/4b4e950eac2a39626c43b6999b00b112.mp4?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SHANHAI\u2019s world you\u2019ll encounter beasts with astonishing abilities. Battle them\u2014or use a <strong>Spirit-Binding Talisman</strong> to capture them to fight alongside you. Why have these creatures grown so ferocious? The secret awaits your discovery. But beware\u2014an unseen gaze seems always fixed upon you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Weapon-Build System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/0b3f2e60c5b79d6494dfc4e1671c68c1.poster.avif?t=1757852991\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/0b3f2e60c5b79d6494dfc4e1671c68c1.webm?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/0b3f2e60c5b79d6494dfc4e1671c68c1.mp4?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of weapons and gear. Through synthesis and upgrades, craft different legendary sets and skills. Socketing different Spirit Orbs grants distinct properties and powers. Ancient relics bestow immense strength\u2014collect and combine them to assemble a one-of-a-kind god-tier loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also employ <strong>Object Mastery</strong> to control additional weapons that aid you in battle, letting you wield multiple ancient artifacts at once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Formidable Ancient Beasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/ebfcce3bd7824143067ed5a645042ed3.poster.avif?t=1757852991\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/ebfcce3bd7824143067ed5a645042ed3.webm?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/ebfcce3bd7824143067ed5a645042ed3.mp4?t=1757852991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle multiple difficulty modes and a permanent meta-progression system. Grow your hero over time and choose the challenge that matches your strength. Mighty ancient divine beasts await\u2014overcome trials, defeat them, and prove your power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Solo or With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4e958b091124324e0bd205a566f2b9d.avif?t=1757852991\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHANHAI: Myth Origins</strong> features five distinct playable characters. Explore alone, or team up in up to 4-player co-op. Trade gear, coordinate around the Five-Element counters, and achieve perfect synergy between attributes and equipment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540450?t=1757852991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/a6474fbeef3871cc1bfcc24cf307b121684f4ff1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757852991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/5ae8688be562c4103587996c85f5074bd3c12131/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757852991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/5ae8688be562c4103587996c85f5074bd3c12131/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757852991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/91bf09450696fec164d15ac57097caf8.avif?t=1757852991\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHANHAI: Myth Origins</strong> 